": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75422375_520607420050846_7237450109782342973_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BX3ulf_G8fAQ7kNvwFpqiwa&_nc_oc=Adpou5DWkFd9jx3rNZugYnbcipLJYUYnMLu8gTCX5ZZUKZ43cbVyqecZuvc9WIpGNW4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUPhwEzgFOZ45uXQ5wJL8UKJLNDZrfiXJys6kxZAvhUlw&oe=6B0EFA5C"}, {"file_name": "SS14.png", "id": "1202922807029259", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75196216_1202922810362592_423759247184353948_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sFkFcLLONNEQ7kNvwGJ7Neq&_nc_oc=AdoMkoHIWYNYLcmcGc_xTYbq3NSNdd3ZaFOEBHMEbTqS9J_UXhIde1efNYSHvpl1VIw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUSXAfyqMByXMbYC6k8M8mCPy9d2Rp9C5SkwN_Gs_LQ4w&oe=6B0EECEE"}, {"file_name": "SS19.png", "id": "609067884419547", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974653_609067887752880_9216955442309026101_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WcaJnoBnfhYQ7kNvwE3EtEK&_nc_oc=AdpHNVH8FOuPqPi2fW99q5LMO_qUnHSJoeSWw4UnHlIXEC6nMSg_DWTvMy5KhIq-OAI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVjmv_Xl96J_Qijc6SdnCK8u2Hz9KEw0V8prKpQB4z1hw&oe=6B0F0548"}, {"file_name": "SS30.png", "id": "602831238543155", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75458101_602831241876488_2307221798185019107_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NqKPGo7ZSmAQ7kNvwGk5QQn&_nc_oc=AdoaXOq8MWD5gZZEATPy-ljYFeXo9cDEZTXCMNRpDZbXKZQ8OzdET8063sJjkraPnJU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVglbkExcbDaKw_HlPhpjRBuMu1kH_q7ZovQ2PD4mlJ6A&oe=6B0F0ABB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560X1440PX_updated.png", "id": "2498647386976144", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57568684_2498647393642810_5244613678942020193_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WUvYB7GykOwQ7kNvwGaVwgk&_nc_oc=AdpmwtjCA-ZHmmfjf5IQjXlEP3_xRJM6UCR30aAQwBudHrkMWrj-loco3Id1ygF2N_s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWTq7i9JqYFEEy2UdX2Lv9z4QqajdOyIYZXoMavEukBmA&oe=6B0EFDAE"}, "display_name": "The Broken Mile", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Millennium: The Broken Mile VR experience puts your skills to the test as you repair a fiber optic network that was damaged by a pesky squirrel. You'll start in an ISP contractor's office as a technician and will learn more about the damage before heading up into an aerial truck to begin repairs. You'll assess your splicing knowledge and troubleshoot the network before restoring the internet to the neighborhood. \n\nShow off your technical prowess with this immersive experience\u2014can you handle it? Try Millennium: The Broken Mile VR experience today and prove you have what it takes!\n\nDisclaimer: Please note that this experience is a simulation and should not be used to replace professional training. Always use appropriate safety protocols when working with fiber optics in real life. ", "short_description": "Millennium unveils a new virtual reality game: \"The Broken Mile.\" From starting at the ISP contractor office to performing an aerial inspection through fixing the fiber break, you will experience the full journey of repairing an actual fiber to the home network. Compete against the pesky squirrel and your fellow contractors to become the fastest technician out there!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://7576425.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/7576425/MILLENNIUM%20THE%20BROKEN%20MILE%20PRIVACY%20POLICY.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Millennium", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://lp.mymillennium.us/the-broken-mile-vr", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category"